 before the demo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T23:13:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706683362","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4918370-1846018067941528","game_id":"steam-4918370","kind":"announcement","title":"I’m working on adding more character customization options to Alia Domus!","summary":"The full game will include three skin tone options and the choice to play as a female character. I’m still working on the new sprites and animations, so these options won’t be available in the demo yet.It’s a substantial amount of work, but I’m excited to give players more ways to make their colonist feel like their own.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T16:27:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941528","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4918370-1846018067927792","game_id":"steam-4918370","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank You for 4,000 Wishlists! What","summary":"We just hit 4,000 wishlists for Alia Domus, and I want to say a huge thank you to everyone who added the game, played the demo, shared feedback, or helped spread the word.Seeing so many people interested in this project means a lot to me. Alia Domus has been a long journey, and every wishlist, comment, playtest, and message helps keep the game moving forward.I also want to thank PC Games for the recent coverage and review. It was great to see the game featured and to read their impressions of Al","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T23:25:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067927792","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4918370-1844751498222775","game_id":"steam-4918370","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Now Available!","summary":"The demo for Alia Domus is now officially live on Steam.This build gives you an early look at the core material-era progression, survival mechanics, and world exploration. You can download it directly from the main store page using the \"Download Demo\" button.Since this is an early look at the game, feedback is welcome. If you run into bugs, notice balance issues, or have thoughts on the progression systems, please leave a post here in the Community Hub discussions.Thank you for following the dev","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T21:52:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498222775","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4918370-1840944183782654","game_id":"steam-4918370","kind":"announcement","title":"2,500 Wishlists, Beta Testing Feedback & Steam Next Fest Demo!","summary":"Hello everyone!I’d like to share a quick update on the current state of Alia Domus’s development.First of all, I want to say a huge thank you to all of you: we recently hit 2,500 wishlists on Steam! This is an amazing milestone for me, and seeing so many people interested in the project truly means a lot.Over the past few weeks, my main focus has been listening closely to our beta testers, fixing bugs, and tweaking various game mechanics based on the direct feedback I’ve been receiving. This rou","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-15T18:20:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183782654","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4918370":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:16:04Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:16:04Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4918370":"2026-10-26T15:16:04Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4918370":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:16:04Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:16:04Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:16:04Z"},"5267760":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:16:04Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:16:04Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:16:04Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4918370","app_id":4918370,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:08Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"cb02b451f75db223f7714476ffe0e287f5c06251e2b2a6bbfeb8926732bd08aa","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"픽셀 아트 생존 RPG에서 미지의 행성을 탐험하고 개척하세요. 자원을 수집하고, 퀘스트를 완료하고, 인류의 다양한 시대의 기술을 제작하여 Alia Domus를 보금자리로 바꾸세요. 기초적인 생존에서 시작해 문명의 화려한 전성기에 도달하세요.","publishers":[{"name":"Cat Crate Games"}],"developers":[{"name":"Cat Crate Games"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1803801600,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_month"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Alia Domus Official Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1784759840","trailer_category":0,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4918370/165963459/7be7abc97dc9dc2ce1d7356abc1285f6ff8d5313/1783792899/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4918370/165963459/7be7abc97dc9dc2ce1d7356abc1285f6ff8d5313/1783792899/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"4918370/165963459/7be7abc97dc9dc2ce1d7356abc1285f6ff8d5313/1783792899/dash_av1.mpd","en